By far and away the most reliable way to increase any one particular
stat is by a blessed potion of gain ability, which will increase them
all.  A ring of adornment will also raise your charisma.  (usually;
sometimes they're cursed.)  Stepping on a magic trap will, very
rarely, add one to your charisma and tame all the monsters within a
certain radius.  (I think 3 squares.)

Stats can be lowered by poison, or by sitting on a throne.  Eating
cursed lumps of royal jelly will lower your strength, and I think
applying a cursed unicorn horn has a chance of lowering one of your
stats.

